{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DEMO MAP AND MAIN GAME MAPS MAY BE SIMILAR</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only two regions of the main map are accessible in the demo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can engage in 3 boss battles as well as several encounters with common enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only a limited set of skills and items are available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some branching dialogues are active in the demo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the city, a few soul characters can be purchased from NPCs, and looted items can be sold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chests containing loot can be found in different locations on the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Statues can be used to restore mana.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo includes a limited selection of combat maps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is not a tale of vengeance or conquest\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is a journey through oblivion, memory, and sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To remember is to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To survive is to save what remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is The\u00a0Last\u00a0Sanctum.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655490?t=1747547854","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655490/7c37a4775d83b43ea96173f31a85996fc6cf9e22/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747547854","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655490/d74085d3f4e907e7de70153a8b17dff82393d989/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747547854","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655490/d74085d3f4e907e7de70153a8b17dff82393d989/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747547854","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DEMO MAP AND MAIN GAME MAPS MAY BE SIMILAR</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only two regions of the main map are accessible in the demo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can engage in 3 boss battles as well as several encounters with common enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only a limited set of skills and items are available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some branching dialogues are active in the demo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the city, a few soul characters can be purchased from NPCs, and looted items can be sold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chests containing loot can be found in different locations on the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Statues can be used to restore mana.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo includes a limited selection of combat maps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is not a tale of vengeance or conquest\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is a journey through oblivion, memory, and sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To remember is to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To survive is to save what remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is The\u00a0Last\u00a0Sanctum.</p>","developers":["Anomalybyte Studio, Sunset Disco"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3646380","name":"The Last Sanctum"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655490/955